# Scenario "fatal": config.vhd with a deliberate defect (configurations fatal_size
# and fatal_sub of sim.py). The firmware stops with the fatal error screen and
# enters the QNICE Monitor, which is then used via UART.
reset
wait_uart 800 Core stopped. Please reset the machine.
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
wait_quiet 3000 100
dump fatal
mark monitor: help, illegal command, examine
send H
wait_uart 600 QMON>\x20
send CX
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
send ME0000
wait_uart 300 QMON>\x20
wait_quiet 2000 100
dump fatal_monitor
end
